n: 9.5.2
kind: hub
name: review-of-nums-model
is: All 39 claims of 3.2.kg (24 observations, 15 findings) were read against NUMS.Go at 9e6bbb4, the round-one report and the run logs the study kept: 39 confirmed, 0 amended, 0 disputed, 0 left unreviewed; nine of the 39 were confirmed on a second reading, after the first reading's amendments had been written into the nodes. Two run results, the three label-numbering runs and the test runs at three earlier commits, could be checked only against the report, because no log of them was kept; no build or test was re-run.
